OL,3,AVoters in Brazil head to polls as Lula
OL,4,Agoes up against Bolsonaro's son
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis is Bolsonaro's election to lose
OL,7,Fafter he came top in the first round of
OL,8,Fvoting on 4 October, which US President
OL,9,FDonald Trump called a "very big"
OL,10,Fvictory.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
