OL,3,AMusk says SpaceX restricted Ukraine's
OL,4,AStarlink connection as service restored
OL,5,
OL,6,FElon Musk has said his company SpaceX
OL,7,Frestricted Ukraine's Starlink internet
OL,8,Fservice, after Ukrainian officials said
OL,9,Fconnectivity issues appeared to have
OL,10,Fbeen resolved.
OL,12,FThe tech billionaire accused Ukraine of
OL,13,Fviolating its terms of service by using
OL,14,Fit for military activity - but denied
OL,15,Fbeing responsible for a simultaneous
OL,16,Fissue with its US-run, military-grade
OL,17,Fcounterpart Starshield.
OL,19,FKyiv has not officially commented on
OL,20,FMusk's latest claim but Ukrainian
OL,21,Fpresidential adviser Serhii Beskrestnov
OL,22,Fsaid his post was "very strange".
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
